# Do not translate line endings in the shipped pages.
#
# dist/ is what production serves and is NOT rebuilt from client/ on deploy, so
# a checkout that "helpfully" rewrote CRLF->LF (or back) would leave the working
# tree byte-different from what is actually running on render1. The tree is
# already mixed on purpose: alt.html is CRLF while index.html and sp.html are LF.
# Leave every one of them exactly as committed.
*.html -text
*.css  -text
*.js   -text

# Preserve exact curated release and installer bytes.
.gitattributes -text
*.cjs -text
data/curated-public-targets.json -text
curation/subtextle-online-20261009/** -text
docs/curated-targets.md -text
